  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Georgia: Increasing Institutional Capacity for Innovation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the EC - World Bank Partnership Program Part III for Europe and Central Asia Programmatic Single-Donor Trust Fund, the European Commission has expressed an interest in ensuring that the Bank provides support to Georgia in the framework of the Trust Fund with the specific objective to support the development of Georgia&#x2019;s innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem through increasing the capacity of Georgia&#x2019;s Innovation and Technology Agency (GITA), demonstrating viability of technology transfer, and crowding-in private capital through improved early stage co-investment schemes.</narrative>
  </description>
